source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-23
observed: A backslash before an escapable character is consumed, so an authored one there has to be encoded instead.
-- input.jira --
C:\{x}
-- rendered.html --
<p>C:{x}</p>
-- want.md --
C:{x}
